guess (who often expects both drops to happen only at scope end).",[14,2230,2231,2234,2235,2237],{},[18,2232,2233],{},"The lesson",": assigning over a live binding with a ",[53,2236,554],{}," type runs the old value's destructor immediately, not at scope end.",[23,2239,2240],{"id":2153},"Summary",[62,2242,2243,2246,2254,2261,2269,2275],{},[31,2244,2245],{},"Each value has one owner; scope-end drops it.",[31,2247,218,2248,2250,2251,2253],{},[53,2249,55],{}," types move on assignment\u002Fpass; ",[53,2252,55],{}," types duplicate.",[31,2255,2256,2258,2259,215],{},[53,2257,554],{}," is a destructor; can't be combined with ",[53,2260,55],{},[31,2262,2263,2264,77,2266,2268],{},"Partial moves, ",[53,2265,1034],{},[53,2267,1037],{}," let you surgically move things around.",[31,2270,2271,2272,2274],{},"Use ",[53,2273,1596],{}," for shared read-only ownership; use channels for moving data between threads.",[31,2276,2277],{},"Understand the difference between moving and borrowing — most APIs should borrow.",[14,2279,2280,2281,2284],{},"Next: References and Borrowing — ",[1764,2282,2283],{},"using"," a value without owning it.",[2286,2287,2288],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .svdQ7, html code.shiki .svdQ7{--shiki-default:#D73A49;--shiki-github-dark:#F97583}html pre.shiki code .ssxIu, html code.shiki .ssxIu{--shiki-default:#24292E;--shiki-github-dark:#E1E4E8}html pre.shiki code .sIsaT, html code.shiki .sIsaT{--shiki-default:#6F42C1;--shiki-github-dark:#B392F0}html pre.shiki code .sJ6F3, html code.shiki .sJ6F3{--shiki-default:#032F62;--shiki-github-dark:#9ECBFF}html pre.shiki code .sdCPZ, html code.shiki .sdCPZ{--shiki-default:#6A737D;--shiki-github-dark:#6A737D}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);fon